Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 09:50:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] perf(chunks): bound repeated block mapping diagnostics

Invalid secondary layer entries can log once per cell across entire chunk batches. A recorded server palette mismatch produced over 100,000 warnings and blocked the client network loop for roughly 30 seconds.

Retain each distinct warning per dimension tracker, up to 64 diagnostics and one suppression notice. Bound memory and synchronize admission across concurrent chunk consumers. Preserve block fallback and waterlogging behavior.
